{"seq":45,"slug":"graph-neural-networks","title":"图神经网络","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"图神经网络\">图神经网络</h1><p>图神经网络（Graph Neural Networks, GNN）是一类专门处理图结构数据的深度学习模型。与传统神经网络假设输入为规则网格（如图像的像素矩阵）或序列（如文本的词序列）不同，GNN 直接在由节点和边组成的拓扑结构上进行信息传递与表示学习，能够捕获实体间复杂的关系模式。</p>\n<p>从社交网络中的用户推荐，到分子结构中的性质预测，再到知识图谱上的推理补全——图无处不在。GNN 为这些问题提供了统一的建模范式：通过邻域聚合机制，每个节点迭代地融合周围邻居的信息，逐层构建出兼具局部结构与全局语义的表示向量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>图神经网络的模型原理、架构设计与工程实践</strong>。与同类别下的兄弟 hub 相比：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../network-graph-analysis/\">网络与图分析</a>侧重传统图论指标（中心性、社区发现、随机图模型），是 GNN 的数学前置；</li>\n<li><a href=\"../causal-inference/\">因果推断</a>中的因果图方法虽然也使用有向图，但其目标是识别因果效应而非学习节点表示；</li>\n<li><a href=\"../probabilistic-graphical-models/\">概率图模型</a>关注贝叶斯网络与马尔可夫随机场的概率推断，而 GNN 更强调判别式的端到端学习。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-7 年经验的中级开发者，建议按以下顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础理论</strong>（第一章）：先掌握消息传递范式、谱图理论直觉和图表示学习的统一视角；</li>\n<li><strong>架构深入</strong>（第二章）：理解 GCN/GAT/GraphSAGE 的设计差异，以及 2024-2026 年兴起的 Graph Transformer 架构；</li>\n<li><strong>应用场景</strong>（第三章）：看 GNN 在分子、推荐、社交网络中的落地方式；</li>\n<li><strong>工程实践</strong>（第四章）：掌握 PyG 框架、大规模训练策略和部署优化。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果你对图论基础不熟悉，建议先阅读<a href=\"../network-graph-analysis/foundations/graph-basics\">网络与图分析 - 图论基础</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>线性代数基础（矩阵运算、特征分解）</li>\n<li>深度学习基础（反向传播、注意力机制、Transformer 架构）</li>\n<li>Python 与 PyTorch 编程经验</li>\n<li>了解基本图论概念（节点、边、邻接矩阵）有帮助但非必须</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"message-passing","title":"消息传递神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/foundations/message-passing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spectral-graph-theory","title":"谱图理论与图卷积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/foundations/spectral-graph-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-representation-learning","title":"图表示学习的统一视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/foundations/graph-representation-learning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectures","title":"架构设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-convolutional-networks","title":"图卷积网络家族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-convolutional-networks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-transformers","title":"Graph Transformer 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-transformers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"heterogeneous-temporal-gnns","title":"异构图与时序图神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/heterogeneous-temporal-gnns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"molecular-property-prediction","title":"分子性质预测与药物发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/molecular-property-prediction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recommender-knowledge-graphs","title":"推荐系统与知识图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/recommender-knowledge-graphs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-network-fraud-detection","title":"社交网络与欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/social-network-fraud-detection"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pyg-framework","title":"PyG 框架深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/pyg-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scalable-gnn-training","title":"大规模图神经网络训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/scalable-gnn-training"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gnn-deployment-optimization","title":"GNN 部署与推理优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/gnn-deployment-optimization"}]}]}